# Push on task finish

When a discrete implementation task is finished (UI fix, feature slice, bugfix),
**commit and push to the current branch immediately** — do not wait to be asked.

- Use the conventional-commits skill / repo commit style.
- Push with `git push origin HEAD` (or `-u` if the branch has no upstream).
- Do not leave finished work only in the working tree.
- Still never force-push to main/master; still never amend pushed commits unless asked.
- If the user says not to commit/push for a specific change, honor that exception.
